sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operador (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema ipm)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant ST as Banco platform (schema ipm)
  U->>R: GET /v1/ipm/roles/{resourceId}
  R-->>U: 200 com resourceVersion
  U->>R: PATCH /v1/ipm/roles/{resourceId} {resourceVersion, displayName, permissions}
  R->>R: valida a permissão ipm.role.update
  R->>M: requested-update (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 operationId
  alt resourceVersion diferente da atual
    M->>DB: Operation rejected (conflict), nada muda
  else aceito
    M->>DB: geração + 1, campos novos, outbox desired
    P->>REC: desired (DESIRED)
    REC->>EX: action update (campos diferem)
    EX->>ST: transação: atualiza ipm.role e permissões
    OB->>M: observed com os campos novos (fase Ready)
  end
  Note over R,EX: deletionProtection precisa ser false antes do DELETE, senão responde 409 DeletionProtected
  U->>R: DELETE /v1/ipm/roles/{resourceId}?resourceVersion=N
  R->>M: requested-delete (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 operationId
  M->>DB: lifecycle absent, fase Deleting, outbox desired
  P->>REC: desired absent (DESIRED)
  REC->>EX: action delete (role ainda presente)
  EX->>ST: DELETE em ipm.role (ausente também é sucesso)
  EX->>REC: completed (RESULT)
  OB->>ST: SELECT em ipm.role
  OB->>M: observed absent
  M->>DB: apaga a linha, Operation completed e publica removed
